🌍 EIA VoiceBridge

AI-Powered Environmental Information & Voice Interaction Platform

EIA VoiceBridge is an AI-powered prototype designed to make environmental information easier to access, understand, and interact with through a simple digital interface.

The project explores how Artificial Intelligence and voice-enabled interaction can help people access useful environmental information in a more accessible and user-friendly way.

🎯 The Problem

Environmental information can sometimes be difficult for people to access or understand, especially when information is presented in complex technical language.

EIA VoiceBridge aims to bridge this gap by providing a simpler way for users to interact with environmental information using AI.

💡 Our Solution

EIA VoiceBridge combines a web interface with Artificial Intelligence to allow users to ask environmental-related questions and receive understandable responses.

The goal is to make environmental knowledge more accessible while demonstrating how AI can be applied to real-world environmental challenges.

⚙️ How It Works

1. The user opens EIA VoiceBridge.
2. The user enters an environmental question.
3. The request is processed through the application.
4. AI generates a response.
5. The user receives the information through the interface.

